<view class="directory">
  <view class="directory-head">
    <view class="directory-title">燕园同窗，天涯比邻</view>
    <view class="directory-sub">寻找志趣相投的校友 · 连接熟悉又崭新的朋友</view>
    <view class="search-box">
      <image class="search-icon" src="/assets/icons/plain-search.png" mode="aspectFit"></image>
      <input
        class="search-input"
        value="{{keyword}}"
        placeholder="搜索姓名、学院或专业方向"
        confirm-type="search"
        bindinput="onSearchInput"
        bindconfirm="onSearchConfirm"
      />
      <text class="search-clear" wx:if="{{keyword}}" bindtap="onClearSearch">×</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="filter-tools">
    <view class="filter-button {{regionLabel !== '全部地区' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="onFilterTap">{{regionLabel}} ▾</view>
    <view class="filter-button {{industryLabel !== '全部行业' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="onFilterTap">{{industryLabel}} ▾</view>
    <text class="filter-count" wx:if="{{total}}">共 {{total}} 位校友</text>
  </view>

  <view class="roster-list">
    <state-view
      status="{{loading && entries.length === 0 ? 'loading' : error ? 'error' : entries.length === 0 ? 'empty' : 'idle'}}"
      error-text="{{error}}"
      empty-text="没有找到符合条件的校友"
      empty-desc="可以更换盟市或行业筛选条件，也可以清空搜索关键词"
      bind:retry="onRetry"
    ></state-view>

    <person-item wx:for="{{entries}}" wx:key="userId" entry="{{item}}" bind:tap="onEntryTap"></person-item>

    <view class="list-foot" wx:if="{{entries.length}}">{{hasMore ? '上拉加载更多' : '— 已经到底了 —'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="privacy-hint">
    <view class="shield"><image class="shield-img" src="/assets/icons/plain-shield.png" mode="aspectFit"></image></view>
    <text>平台仅展示校友本人授权公开的资料；联系方式不直接公开，需经过双方同意。</text>
  </view>
</view>
